      "description": "Arrow Escape - Classic Puzzle for Watch This is a classic arrow elimination game specifically designed for smartwatches. Swipe to move and help all arrows escape the screen. Rotate the watch crown to zoom in and out for a better view of the layout. Clear all arrows within the time limit to pass the level. Challenge your logic and reaction speed anytime, anywhere, right on your wrist.",
